=== p77 'SHIT': which way did the paint run? ===
  paint 160780 px; thin (local half-width <=8 px) 81190; thick (>=20 px) 29309
  centroid y: thin 3168.1, thick 3207.2 -> the thin ink sits 39.1 px ABOVE the cores
  thick-core y range 2996..3405; thin ink y range 2627..3517
  thin ink reaches 369 px ABOVE the core top and only 112 px below the core bottom (ratio 3.29:1)
  vertical ink-profile skewness -0.605 (negative = long tail toward the TOP of the printed page)
  mean local half-width: top 10% of the ink 3.52 px, bottom 10% 6.41 px
  Gravity pulls paint DOWN.  These runs go UP -> the graffiti photograph
  is placed on the page 180 deg from the way the paint dried.

